{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"C3-01","example":{"issue":{"title":"平交道靠近路口，能否避免車隊滯留？","intro":"平交道與號誌路口距離近，須一起檢視淨空與車流銜接。","images":[{"key":"results:c3-01-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"crop":[1207.799,91.955,1747.064,2062.234]},{"key":"results:c3-01-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:c3-01-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"guidance","title":"車流導引不明確","text":"大面積網狀線可提醒保持淨空，但行車路徑仍不夠清楚。"},{"id":"queue","title":"車隊可能回堵到平交道","text":"路口與平交道過近，停等車隊可能占用淨空範圍，牌面也易混雜。"},{"id":"pedestrian","title":"行人穿越設施不完整","text":"行人通行與穿越空間缺少完整安排。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[125,126],"strategy":{"title":"提前提示平交道，維持鐵路淨空","intro":"從進入前的警示、穿越範圍到鄰近號誌協調，避免車輛滯留。","images":[{"key":"results:c3-01-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"warning","title":"提前辨識鐵路平交道","text":"搭配近鐵路平交道線、有柵門警告標誌及電化鐵路遵行標誌，提醒前方穿越處。","moduleId":"M4-01"},{"id":"clearance","title":"清楚界定必須淨空的範圍","text":"以網狀線標示鐵路的動態包絡區域，避免車輛排隊停留在鐵道上。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"coordination","title":"協調鄰近路口號誌","text":"當號誌路口距離平交道較近時，一起檢視放行與回堵，避免車流相互影響。","moduleId":"M2-03"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/05-complex-scenarios/05-3-01-railway-level-crossing.typ","sha256":"e0b9355c39eee03d3cff0b26147de9b1b785559b50ce4789d6bf0aa4b01f26e3","scenario":"C3-01","title":"鐵路平交道","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:c3-01-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C3-01/C3-01_現況圖_01.png","width":4138,"height":2832,"label":"C3-01 現況圖","scenario":"C3-01","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":125,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image148.png","sha256":"a8e2ace5e759e2011fe9b05a3a6989a6c66624700f7362543208f891880a412c"},"results:c3-01-photo-1":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C3-01/C3-01_現況照片_01.png","width":1725,"height":1118,"label":"C3-01 現況照片","scenario":"C3-01","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sha256":"b8d496c63c31802d2236d14e741e05a6602182adee88b8cbff1530835c9f0b81","source":{"file":"C3-01_